    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Island Treasure</strong></i> &quot;is the first game developed by Guohe Studio. The game is a casual game that combines action and decryption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/e04e5da3b7957fd6a114dea85e619e59.avif?t=1748312362\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action</strong>: Run, jump and avoid traps, get a sword and defeat the devil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/2d1b2c51ba767696125834bfb534b26f.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/2d1b2c51ba767696125834bfb534b26f.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/2d1b2c51ba767696125834bfb534b26f.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/ecea1883f5f4c9842dd46a9a500f9a6c.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/ecea1883f5f4c9842dd46a9a500f9a6c.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/ecea1883f5f4c9842dd46a9a500f9a6c.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/8742aaed1a17a61d48744bbfbed6315e.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/8742aaed1a17a61d48744bbfbed6315e.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/8742aaed1a17a61d48744bbfbed6315e.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decryption</strong>: Search for treasure chests, obtain keys and treasures, and find the map to the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/9c01ff8150291934d43d2d0b70724ebb.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/9c01ff8150291934d43d2d0b70724ebb.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/9c01ff8150291934d43d2d0b70724ebb.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/004a3171feeb4026a02fbe879637d1e9.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/004a3171feeb4026a02fbe879637d1e9.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/004a3171feeb4026a02fbe879637d1e9.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps acquiring a certain ability is the key to unlocking a secret~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy this game!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Island Treasure</strong></i> &quot;is the first game developed by Guohe Studio. The game is a casual game that combines action and decryption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/e04e5da3b7957fd6a114dea85e619e59.avif?t=1748312362\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action</strong>: Run, jump and avoid traps, get a sword and defeat the devil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/2d1b2c51ba767696125834bfb534b26f.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/2d1b2c51ba767696125834bfb534b26f.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/2d1b2c51ba767696125834bfb534b26f.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/ecea1883f5f4c9842dd46a9a500f9a6c.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/ecea1883f5f4c9842dd46a9a500f9a6c.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/ecea1883f5f4c9842dd46a9a500f9a6c.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/8742aaed1a17a61d48744bbfbed6315e.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/8742aaed1a17a61d48744bbfbed6315e.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/8742aaed1a17a61d48744bbfbed6315e.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decryption</strong>: Search for treasure chests, obtain keys and treasures, and find the map to the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/9c01ff8150291934d43d2d0b70724ebb.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/9c01ff8150291934d43d2d0b70724ebb.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/9c01ff8150291934d43d2d0b70724ebb.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/004a3171feeb4026a02fbe879637d1e9.poster.avif?t=1748312362\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/004a3171feeb4026a02fbe879637d1e9.webm?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/004a3171feeb4026a02fbe879637d1e9.mp4?t=1748312362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps acquiring a certain ability is the key to unlocking a secret~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy this game!</p>",
